	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• 「ゲキドライヴ」の世界を無限に広げるカスタムパーツシリーズ。",
			"• 相手マシンや外壁との接触ロスを軽減するシールド。",
			"• GDマシンサイドの凸凹を減らし、サイドバイサイドからの追い抜きを実現。",
			"• すべてのGDマシンに装着可能。外見も大きく変化。",
			"• 新規成形のレーサーズロックが２個付属。GDマシンのドレスアップにも活用可能。"
		],
		"en": [
			"• A custom parts series that infinitely expands the world of \"Geki Drive\".",
			"• Seal to reduce contact loss with opponent machines and outer walls.",
			"• Reduces unevenness on the side of the GD machine, allowing for side-by-side overtaking.",
			"• Can be installed on all GD machines. The appearance has also changed significantly.",
			"• Two newly molded racer locks are included. Can also be used to dress up GD machines."
		]
